#: Module.php:671
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Select the basemap provider. The default is OpenStreetMap.Mapnik. These "
"providers are offered AS-IS. There is no guarantee of service or speed. "
"Stamen needs this installation's domain registered with a Stadia account at "
"%s; one registration covers every site. To help visitors with low vision, "
"consider Esri.NatGeoWorldMap or OpenTopoMap, which have higher contrast "
"between map features."
msgstr ""

#: Module.php:689
msgid "Carto API key"
msgstr ""

#: Module.php:691
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Without a key, Carto watermarks every tile, so Carto basemaps show "
"OpenStreetMap instead. Applies to every site in this installation, and is "
"visible to anyone who views a map. Get a key at %s."
msgstr ""

#: Module.php:707
msgid "Mapbox access token"
msgstr ""

#: Module.php:709
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Without a token, Mapbox serves no tiles, so the Mapbox basemap shows "
"OpenStreetMap instead. Usage is billed to the token's account. Applies to "
"every site in this installation, and is visible to anyone who views a map. "
"Get a token at %s."
msgstr ""

#: Module.php:758
msgid ""
"Set the default bounds of the map by navigating to the desired view and "
"clicking \"Set the current view as the default view\"."
msgstr ""

#: Module.php:810
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Select the basemap provider. Leave empty to use the global setting (%s). "
"These providers are offered AS-IS. There is no guarantee of service or "
"speed. Basemaps needing a key or token use credentials set in global "
"settings, and show OpenStreetMap until those are set. To help visitors with "
"low vision, consider Esri.NatGeoWorldMap or OpenTopoMap, which have higher "
"contrast between map features."
msgstr ""

#: Module.php:813
msgid "[Global setting]"
msgstr ""

#: Module.php:828
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Set the minimum zoom level of the map. Leave empty to use the global setting"
" (%s)."
msgstr ""

#: Module.php:847
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Set the maximum zoom level of the map. Leave empty to use the global setting"
" (%s)."
msgstr ""

#: Module.php:865
msgid ""
"Set the default bounds of the map by navigating to the desired view and "
"clicking \"Set the current view as the default view\". Leave unconfigured to"
" use the global setting."
msgstr ""

